    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Located in the heart of Summercove village, right next door to The Bulman Bar, this very attractive 3 bedroomed townhouse has been completely renovated to a high standard, in a very scenic and most sought after location.\n\nFilled with natural light, the property boasts a spacious open-plan living and kitchen area, along with a master bedroom complete with en-suite, both located on the first floor and enjoying panoramic sea views.The ground floor consists of two bedrooms, family bathroom, utility room and internal garage. The property is beautifully presented in immaculate condition. \n\nBeing just a stone`s throw from the sea, with The Bulman next door, Charles Fort just uphill, and stunning scenic coastal walks to the east towards Preghane Point and to the west into Kinsale town, this property offers an exceptional lifestyle in a beautiful coastal setting. The property also benefits from gas-fired central heating.\n\nAvailable from: 1st September 2026\n\n***Applications now invited by EMAIL ONLY***.\n\n***Strictly No Pets *** \n***Strictly No Smoking*** \n***References Required*** \n\nname\nemail\nphone number"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Notice\nAll photographs are provided for guidance only."
      },
