        "Content": "<ul><li> first letting </li><li> stunning sea views </li><li> open plan first floor living / kitchen </li><li> 3 bedroom townhouse </li><li> excellent location in the heart of Summercove </li><li> bright and light modern decor presented in immaculate condition </li><li> complete renovated to the highest standards </li><li> gas heating </li><li> Eircode: P17 VH36</li></ul>"
      },
